msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In this guide, we will work with a few components deployed in a Kubernetes "
"cluster:"
msgstr ""

msgid "A simple blue service."
msgstr ""

msgid "A simple red service."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `color-service` is the Kubernetes service which is the entry point to "
"the Blue and Red instances."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A client service using a REST client to call the blue or the red service. "
"Service discovery and selection are delegated to Stork."
msgstr ""

