msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and "
"create the applications step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the completed example."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download "
"an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The solution is located in the `stork-kubernetes-quickstart` link:"
"{quickstarts-tree-url}/stork-kubernetes-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Discovery and selection"
msgstr ""

msgid "Before going further, we need to discuss discovery vs. selection."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Service discovery is the process of locating service instances.\n"
"It produces a list of service instances that is potentially empty (if no "
"service matches the request) or contains multiple service instances."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Service selection, also called load-balancing, chooses the best instance "
"from the list returned by the discovery process.\n"
"The result is a single service instance or an exception when no suitable "
"instance can be found."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Stork handles both discovery and selection.\n"
"However, it does not handle the communication with the service but only "
"provides a service instance.\n"
"The various integrations in Quarkus extract the location of the service from "
"that service instance."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bootstrapping the project"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Create a Quarkus project importing the quarkus-rest-client, quarkus-rest, "
"and quarkus-smallrye-stork extensions using your favorite approach:"
msgstr ""

msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` "
"option."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about how to install and use the Quarkus CLI, see the "
"xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] guide."
msgstr ""

msgid "Maven"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool="
"gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr ""

msgid "For Windows users:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If using cmd, (don't use backward slash `\\` and put everything on the same "
"line)"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If using Powershell, wrap `-D` parameters in double quotes e.g. `\"-"
"DprojectArtifactId={create-app-artifact-id}\"`"
msgstr ""

msgid "In the generated project, also add the following dependencies:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`stork-service-discovery-kubernetes` provides an implementation of service "
"discovery for Kubernetes. `stork-load-balancer-random` provides an "
"implementation of random load balancer. `quarkus-kubernetes` enables the "
"generation of Kubernetes manifests each time we perform a build. The "
"`quarkus-kubernetes-client` extension enables the use of the Fabric8 "
"Kubernetes Client in native mode. And `quarkus-container-image-jib` enables "
"the build of a container image using https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/"
"jib[Jib]."
msgstr ""

